{"meta":{"id":"tt42727894","type":"series","name":"Romelia War Chronicle","imdb_id":"tt42727894","description":"Romelia y su grupo logran derrotar al Rey Demonio Zelgis, aunque la temeraria carga del Príncipe Henri los obliga a librar una agotadora batalla. Tras la batalla, Romelia es tildada de \"peso muerto\" por no combatir directamente, y el Príncipe rompe unilateralmente su compromiso con ella. Sin un lugar en las celebraciones de la victoria, Romelia regresa a casa, donde solo encuentra la indiferencia de su familia y la sociedad. Sin embargo, ella se niega a quebrarse. Ya tiene la mirada puesta en el camino que le espera","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt42727894.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6LeBjYSPULKwSv5R6sX6Iovwoad.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hXWCx0n6cYBMcjngZ8M2iZXLwmZ.png","genres":["Animación","Action & Adventure","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"releaseInfo":"2026-","released":"2026-10-05T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","imdbRating":"7.4","country":"Japan","cast":["根本優奈","小笠原仁","大野智敬","広瀬裕也","千本木彩花","伊瀬茉莉也","亜咲花","千葉翔也","Gakuto Kajiwara","堀江瞬","Ryûnosuke Watanuki","Hiromichi Tezuka","Tomohiro Yamaguchi","Ryuichi Hirose","Kenta Hosoda","Tasuku Kaito","Rikuya Yasuda","Hiroki Matsukawa","Taiki Yamashita","Souhei Horikane","Yuki Sakurai","Mizuki Ishii","Hayate Kimura","Shuntaro Hara","Hiromu Mineta","Mika Kanda","Kenji Hamada","Yoji Ueda"],"writer":["皐月彩"],"links":[{"name":"7.4","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt42727894"},{"name":"Animación","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Animaci%C3%B3n"},{"name":"Action & Adventure","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Action+%26+Adventure"},{"name":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2